abstract: >-
  Two first-party open datasets documenting Parle: French Pronunciation:
  a bounded 35-entry beginner French sound inventory and a 120-mission
  A0-A2 speaking course map. This is product documentation and open data,
  not an independent review, linguistic standard, assessment, or endorsement.
